Subject: Another question about scheduling
Message-ID: <EWWilTW8Aj4.vlXXPxGcBAAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/simmer-devel/c/EWWilTW8Aj4/m/vlXXPxGcBAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Say you have a bank with a resource ‘teller'  that has a schedule from 9 to 5. It is 5pm but the teller is still ‘seized’ by a customer. Will the teller be automatically released by 5pm or will the resource stay seized until ‘timeout’?
Regards,

From u0f5b7adb7e70bd8b at groups.google.com  Sat Jul  7 12:47:58 2018
From: u0f5b7adb7e70bd8b at groups.google.com (=?utf-8?b?ScOxYWtpIMOaY2Fy?=)
Date: Sat, 07 Jul 2018 12:47:58 +0000
Subject: Re: [simmer-devel] Another question about scheduling
Message-ID: <EWWilTW8Aj4.xOY_bai3CwAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <EWWilTW8Aj4.vlXXPxGcBAAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
References: <EWWilTW8Aj4.vlXXPxGcBAAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/simmer-devel/c/EWWilTW8Aj4/m/xOY_bai3CwAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

El sáb., 7 jul. 2018 a las 4:11, Cwei (<slende...@gmail.com>) escribió:
>
>
> Say you have a bank with a resource ‘teller'  that has a schedule from 9 to 5. It is 5pm but the teller is still ‘seized’ by a customer. Will the teller be automatically released by 5pm or will the resource stay seized until ‘timeout’?

It depends.

- If preemptive=FALSE, it will stay.
- If preemptive=TRUE, it will be dropped from the server, so if the
queue_size changes to 0 and the resource has queue_size_strict=TRUE
defined, then the customer will be rejected.

> Regards,
>

Iñaki

